WEBVTT

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:02.815
this narrative has been driving me
a little bit crazy.

00:03:02.839 --> 00:03:04.573
But it's not the only one.

00:03:05.014 --> 00:03:07.260
The other narrative
that I'm going to talk about

00:03:07.284 --> 00:03:09.299
is the idea of the superimmigrant.

00:03:09.323 --> 00:03:12.045
In America, we love
to idolize superimmigrants

00:03:12.069 --> 00:03:14.890
as the ideal symbols of American success.

00:03:15.536 --> 00:03:17.551
I grew up admiring superimmigrants,

00:03:17.575 --> 00:03:21.663
because their existence fueled my dreams
and it gave me hope.

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:26.014
The problem with this narrative
is that it also seems to cast a shadow

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:27.498
on those that don't succeed

00:03:27.522 --> 00:03:30.109
or that don't make it
in that way, as less than.